WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.300
This is your brain.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.240
This is your brain watching the President

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.460
talk about spending more money on anti drug commercials.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.020
This is your brain reading a comprehensive
government study

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.260
about the failure of government funded anti
drug commercials.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:17.660
This is your brain unable to fall asleep distraught
in the knowledge that the drug war

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.220
has caused more harm, loss of lives and destruction
than the drugs themselves.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.600
This is your brain pouring a drink, noting
the irony of past prohibitions and their failure.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.360
So here's the question:

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.900
Why are we doing this again?

